Fixes placing orders, invoicing and refunding when Wallee API credentials are not configured.

Symptom: placing an order, registering an invoice or refunding a credit memo fails with
"InvalidArgumentException: Wallee User ID is missing or invalid.", regardless of the payment method used (e.g. checkmo),
e.g. in integration tests or on stores without Wallee configured.

Root cause: Wallee\PluginCore\Sdk\SdkProvider reads the API credentials in its constructor, and every SDK gateway
calls SdkProvider::getService() in its own constructor. Observers and plugins instantiated for every order therefore build the SDK eagerly:
- sales_quote_payment_import_data_before -> Observer\ImportPaymentData -> Model\Service\Quote\TransactionService
  -> PluginCore\Transaction\TransactionService -> TransactionGateway -> SdkProvider
- sales_model_service_quote_submit_success -> Observer\SubmitQuote -> Model\Service\Order\TransactionService,
  TransactionInfoManagement and PluginCore\Charge\ChargeService -> ChargeGateway -> SdkProvider
- sales_order_invoice_register / sales_order_invoice_cancel -> Observer\RegisterInvoice / Observer\CancelInvoice
  -> TransactionGatewayInterface -> SdkProvider
- CreditmemoService::refund() -> Plugin\Sales\Model\Service\CreditmemoService -> LineItemReductionService, RefundService
  and PluginCore\Refund\RefundService -> RefundGateway -> SdkProvider
Fix: inject lazy proxies for these dependencies. They are only used for Wallee payments, so the SDK is built
only when the Wallee API is actually called. A proxy on SdkProvider itself would not help, because gateways call it in their constructors.

diff --git a/etc/di.xml b/etc/di.xml
index 5167f59..5e9f9dc 100644
--- a/etc/di.xml
+++ b/etc/di.xml
@@ -314,4 +314,38 @@
 
     <preference for="Wallee\Payment\Api\PaymentMetadataManagementInterface" type="Wallee\Payment\Model\PaymentMetadataManagement" />
     <preference for="Wallee\Payment\Api\GuestPaymentMetadataManagementInterface" type="Wallee\Payment\Model\GuestPaymentMetadataManagement" />
+
+    <type name="Wallee\Payment\Model\Service\Quote\TransactionService">
+        <arguments>
+            <argument name="pluginCoreTransactionService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\PluginCore\Transaction\TransactionService\Proxy</argument>
+        </arguments>
+    </type>
+
+    <type name="Wallee\Payment\Observer\SubmitQuote">
+        <arguments>
+            <argument name="transactionService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\Payment\Model\Service\Order\TransactionService\Proxy</argument>
+            <argument name="transactionInfoManagement" xsi:type="object">Wallee\Payment\Api\TransactionInfoManagementInterface\Proxy</argument>
+            <argument name="chargeService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\PluginCore\Charge\ChargeService\Proxy</argument>
+        </arguments>
+    </type>
+
+    <type name="Wallee\Payment\Observer\RegisterInvoice">
+        <arguments>
+            <argument name="transactionGateway" xsi:type="object">Wallee\PluginCore\Transaction\TransactionGatewayInterface\Proxy</argument>
+        </arguments>
+    </type>
+
+    <type name="Wallee\Payment\Observer\CancelInvoice">
+        <arguments>
+            <argument name="transactionGateway" xsi:type="object">Wallee\PluginCore\Transaction\TransactionGatewayInterface\Proxy</argument>
+        </arguments>
+    </type>
+
+    <type name="Wallee\Payment\Plugin\Sales\Model\Service\CreditmemoService">
+        <arguments>
+            <argument name="lineItemReductionService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\Payment\Model\Service\LineItemReductionService\Proxy</argument>
+            <argument name="refundService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\Payment\Model\Service\RefundService\Proxy</argument>
+            <argument name="pluginCoreRefundService" xsi:type="object">Wallee\PluginCore\Refund\RefundService\Proxy</argument>
+        </arguments>
+    </type>
 </config>
